{"person_name": "Lady Jessica", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "the Lady Jessica, who guided her son in the Bene Gesserit Way", "start": 168, "end": 222}, {"text": "the wisdom of seeding the known universe with a prophecy pattern for the protection of B.G. personnel", "start": 1085, "end": 1168}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica took her hand from Paul's shoulder. \"Your Reverence, I --\" \"Jessica, you know it must be done.\"", "start": 276, "end": 344}, {"text": "the Lady Jessica's latent abilities were grossly underestimated", "start": 1225, "end": 1275}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.4, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica straightened. \"Yes . . . of course.\"", "start": 345, "end": 380}, {"text": "Jessica's hand went to Paul's shoulder, tightened there.", "start": 66, "end": 118}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica took her hand from Paul's shoulder. \"Your Reverence, I --\" \"Jessica, you know it must be done.\"", "start": 276, "end": 344}, {"text": "the Lady Jessica was my serving wench, lad, for fourteen years at school.", "start": 0, "end": 66}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "For a heartbeat, fear pulsed through her palm. Then she had herself under control.", "start": 118, "end": 176}, {"text": "Yet he felt an angry apprehension at the fear he sensed radiating from his mother.", "start": 380, "end": 448}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_5", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_6", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_22", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_33", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_34", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_58", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_59", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_65", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_88", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_92", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_108", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_109", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_128", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_167", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_168", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_169", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_194", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_215", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_216", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_271", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_302", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_303", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_334", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_389", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_501", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_607", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_624", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_669", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_670", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_673", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_674"]}
{"person_name": "duke", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Arrakis would be a place so different from Caladan that Paul's mind whirled with the new knowledge.", "start": 451, "end": 523}, {"text": "And I said that's what Dr. Yueh calls the Mystery of Life.", "start": 2955, "end": 3007}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Hawat tells me we have a plan for the Fremen", "start": 3655, "end": 3693}, {"text": "And the Duke thought: The truth could be worse than he imagines, but even dangerous facts are valuable if you've been trained to deal with them.", "start": 3875, "end": 3980}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The Duke forced himself to the casual gesture, sat down on a corner of the table, smiled.", "start": 3603, "end": 3665}, {"text": "The pattern froze before it could be vocalized, confronted by the single thought: This is my son.", "start": 3666, "end": 3735}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.4, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "And you in your pride thought you could produce the Kwisatz Haderach!", "start": 2220, "end": 2270}, {"text": "And I wanted to run and warn my father, but she said he'd already been warned -- by you, by Mother, by many people.", "start": 2780, "end": 2865}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul lay awake wondering: What's a gom jabbar?", "start": 270, "end": 308}, {"text": "Paul blurted. He clenched his fists, feeling his palms slippery with perspiration.", "start": 3775, "end": 3835}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_1", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_2", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_5", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_6", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-