{"person_name": "Paul Atreides", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.8, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "She said a good ruler has to learn his world's language, that it's different for every world.", "start": 1013, "end": 1085}, {"text": "Paul followed his mother's example, gestalting the room, seeing the workbench down one side, the walls of featureless rock.", "start": 3663, "end": 3743}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul felt that all his past, every experience before this night, had become sand curling in an hourglass.", "start": 2705, "end": 2775}, {"text": "Paul thought back to the moment of impotent rage as the strange 'thopter dived out of the night onto them.", "start": 2925, "end": 2995}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul felt a sharp pang of fear. He looked across at the Mentat's puzzled frown.", "start": 472, "end": 532}, {"text": "Paul looked down at his right hand clenched into a fist beneath the table. Slowly, he willed the muscles to relax.", "start": 870, "end": 950}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul shrugged. \"Then she said a good ruler has to learn his world's language, that it's different for every world.\"", "start": 1010, "end": 1085}, {"text": "Paul returned his attention to the cages, saw that the animals were brownwinged bats.", "start": 3840, "end": 3890}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.4, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul felt a sharp pang of fear. He looked across at the Mentat's puzzled frown.", "start": 472, "end": 532}, {"text": "Paul felt the thought gall him, but could not deny the wisdom in what they did.", "start": 2805, "end": 2865}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_36", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_37", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_188", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_245", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_246", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_287", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_288", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_289", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_296", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_551", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_616", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_670"]}
{"person_name": "Harkonnens", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "There had been so many things to learn. Arrakis would be a place so different from Caladan that Paul's mind whirled with the new knowledge.", "start": 451, "end": 551}, {"text": "Paul nodded, holding his attention on his father's face. He felt some revelation impending.", "start": 3663, "end": 3725}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul took a deep breath to still his trembling. \"If I call out there'll be servants on you in seconds and you'll die.\"", "start": 1081, "end": 1155}, {"text": "Paul got to his feet, moved around the table. \"You're going today?\"", "start": 2225, "end": 2270}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.4, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Pride overcame Paul's fear. \"You dare suggest a duke's son is an animal?\" he demanded.", "start": 1000, "end": 1060}, {"text": "Paul stared at his father, unable to speak for a moment, then: \"A Mentat? Me? But I . . . \"", "start": 4140, "end": 4195}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Paul took a deep breath to still his trembling. \"If I call out there'll be servants on you in seconds and you'll die.\"", "start": 1081, "end": 1155}, {"text": "Paul nodded, holding his attention on his father's face. He felt some revelation impending.", "start": 3663, "end": 3725}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Curiosity reduced Paul's fear to a manageable level. He heard truth in the old woman's voice, no denying it.", "start": 1165, "end": 1235}, {"text": "Paul took a deep breath to still his trembling. \"If I call out there'll be servants on you in seconds and you'll die.\"", "start": 1081, "end": 1155}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_1